# Liquibase + native-image reachability

When adding or including a Liquibase changelog, also register it as a resource glob in **both**:

- `src/main/resources/META-INF/native-image/io.argorand.poc/dcpass/reachability-metadata.json`
- `src/main/resources/META-INF/native-image/io.argorand.poc/dcpass/reachability-metadata.filled.json`

Insert a `resources.globs` entry next to the other `config/liquibase/changelog/*.xml` paths (keep chronological order):

```json
{
  "glob": "config/liquibase/changelog/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description.xml"
}
```

Native image will not see the changeset if it is only added to `master.xml`.
